cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Room-Type Classifier for Floor Plans"
authors:
  - family-names: "Paglia"
    given-names: "Gabriele"
type: software
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-09-25"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/your-github-username/room-type-classifier"
abstract: >-
  A ResNet-18 room-type classifier for floor plans, trained on CubiCasa5K and
  adapted to Danish listing plans with a hand-labelled dataset of 649 rooms;
  accuracy on Danish plans rose from 47.8% to 84.3% (house-grouped 5-fold
  cross-validation).
keywords:
  - floor plans
  - room classification
  - domain adaptation
  - transfer learning
  - PyTorch
